      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I do think having a reversed version of \"When Muted\" would be good. Having it so that my mic doesn't show when I am muted and show when I am unmuted would be better in my own opinion than the other way around",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
